{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17277","headline":"送张仆射朝见毕归镇 · 权德舆","name":"送张仆射朝见毕归镇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青光照目青门曙，玉勒琱戈拥驺驭。\n东方连帅南阳公，文武吉甫如古风。\n独奉新恩来谒帝，感深更见新诗丽。\n共看三接欲爲霖，却念百城同望岁。\n双旌去去恋储胥，归路莺花伴隼旟。\n今日汉庭求上略，留侯自有一编书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}